HB0072 Protecting privacy in public spaces act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lawley, Andrew, Angelos, Banks,
Bratten, Guggenmos, Haroldson, Heiner, Kelly, Larson,
JT, Neiman, Washut, Williams and Wylie and Senator(s)
Brennan, Crago, Hutchings, Jones and Olsen
AN ACT relating to the administration of the government; specifying requirements
for the use of sex-designated restrooms, showers, sleeping quarters and locker
room facilities at public facilities; providing for complaints and civil
actions; specifying duties for public entities; providing definitions; making
conforming amendments; and providing for an effective date.
