"(ii) Harass another person in a changing area, restroom or sleeping
quarters that is designed for males or females. As used in this paragraph,
"harass" includes threats, lewd or obscene statements or images, and
nonconsensual physical contact, directed at a specific person that the harasser
knew or should have known would cause a reasonable person to suffer substantial
fear for their safety or substantial emotional distress.".

